text:
My (23F) boyfriend (22M) keeps disappearing We've been dating for 9 days so far, and it's all online, since we're from different countries. There's a 2 hours difference. Even before we started dating, he's been disappearing every now and then without explanation, maybe because I haven't asked him why yet and I must admit that I'm nervous to do so, not sure why. Three days ago, he told me he has to work and he'll be back at night. I've been staying up all night during these three days waiting and I can't call him. It's 5 AM at the time I'm writing this post. I'm upset but at the same time I'm panicking that something might have happened, I can't tell if I'm being paranoid or not, considering that it's a behavior that keeps repeating itself.

&#x200B;

TLDR: My boyfriend (Long Distance) keeps disappearing and I'm worried and upset.
